{"data": [{"author_id": "1658968675389513729", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:20:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113032661065404595"], "id": "2113032661065404595", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4515650200", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112964878214578452", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@monicaonairtalk @XSpaces @DataRepublican @CynicalPublius Have your Grok Bot add it to your calendar with a reminder!!", "url": "https://x.com/Ineedafarm/status/2113032661065404595"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113032304448921600"]}, "author_id": "1818311005698678784", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:18:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113032311096946910"], "id": "2113032311096946910", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2021, "like_count": 37, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "FSD adoption is exploding\n\nOver 75% of new Teslas delivered in North America now come with FSD (Supervised), up nearly 20 percentage points in just one quarter\n\n\u2022 1.74M active FSD subscriptions, up 67% year over year\n\u2022 Record net new subscriptions\n\u2022 4 new EU approvals: https://t.co/DL5ooc2V0G", "url": "https://x.com/XFreeze/status/2113032311096946910"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113028656188866560"]}, "author_id": "1818311005698678784", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:04:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113028661809188884"], "id": "2113028661809188884", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2516, "like_count": 31, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "Tesla just dropped its Q3 2026 update, and it's packed\n\nHere's everything you need to know\n\nThe numbers\n\u2022 Revenue: $28.0B\n\u2022 Gross profit: $5.5B, up 9% year over year\n\u2022 Operating cash flow: $6.3B\n\u2022 Cash and investments: $45.4B\n\u2022 Trailing 12-month revenue above $100B for the https://t.co/CwJ9dLdpZv", "url": "https://x.com/XFreeze/status/2113028661809188884"}, {"author_id": "2093820967407550465", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:02:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113028184661008541"], "id": "2113028184661008541", "in_reply_to_user_id": "20402945", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113025709539013077", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@CNBC Duet makes five of these from big labs in about 41 days, after Muse, Dots, Grok Bot and Gemini Spark. The fight now is over who gets your inbox and calendar permissions first.", "url": "https://x.com/zandemha/status/2113028184661008541"}, {"article": {"title": "ELON CHRON: 21st of October, 2026"}, "author_id": "1234183597583740929", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:45:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113023821338800567"], "id": "2113023821338800567", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 1382, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "https://t.co/kWa0uo3Qtn", "url": "https://x.com/SERobinsonJr/status/2113023821338800567"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:44:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113023708281426280"], "id": "2113023708281426280", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1648700580309749761", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113023480958775477", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SatuDua12Satu1 @unicodef1wn True. SpaceXAI has 56 official Grok Bot use cases plus a marketplace of about 90 templates. Add them in one click for free once you have Grok Bot access on a paid plan. They handle inbox, invoices, calls, vacuums and more.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2113023708281426280"}, {"author_id": "1681890517666390016", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:39:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113022311959777486"], "id": "2113022311959777486", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 141, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Claude just entered the personal agent space with Claude Duet. \n\nGrok Bot finally has real competition.\n\nDots is tragic.\n\n4 things matter to me here:\n\n1. the model underneath matters more than people think. if i\u2019m giving an agent access to my email, calendar, files and browser, i https://t.co/NlxAqVuaf5", "url": "https://x.com/yuhasbeentaken/status/2113022311959777486"}, {"author_id": "49371864", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:33:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113020879823065090"], "id": "2113020879823065090", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 83, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83e\udd16 Would you let an AI watch your email, your calendar and your Stripe, and only ping you when it actually needs you? Or is that still too much? Tell me below \ud83d\udc47\n\nAnthropic launched Claude Duet, an agent that keeps working for you even when you step away.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 What it is\n\u2022", "url": "https://x.com/Magnosud/status/2113020879823065090"}, {"article": {"title": "I turned my gift-link app into a Grok Bot. Here's how."}, "author_id": "748951137278042112", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:28:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113019506478260250"], "id": "2113019506478260250", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I turned GiveStash into a Grok Bot that catches gift links in my inbox and puts reminders on my calendar. Here's the setup and prompt so you can build your own. https://t.co/JyLbLaGAvO", "url": "https://x.com/thatsatechnique/status/2113019506478260250"}, {"article": {"title": "Karpathy\u2019s Second Brain Got 22M Views. But It Was Missing One Thing."}, "author_id": "1428098894232276996", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:27:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113019252785521014"], "id": "2113019252785521014", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 234, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/1Gua61vAMx", "url": "https://x.com/Ovrento/status/2113019252785521014"}, {"article": {"title": "Wednesday Scraps for October 21 '26"}, "author_id": "2050739942892990465", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:24:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113018611614839174"], "id": "2113018611614839174", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 128, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/FgDV3PVmFh", "url": "https://x.com/fintwitscraps/status/2113018611614839174"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113017932645326848"]}, "author_id": "2029271146445848578", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:22:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113018027633791203"], "id": "2113018027633791203", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2507, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "SITUATION EXPLAINED: Anthropic just announced Claude Duet, an app where Claude keeps working for you even after you step away.\n\n\u2022 It\u2019s a proactive agent that comes to you with what needs attention, finishes tasks you hand it, and runs on its own cloud computer\n\u2022 Every morning https://t.co/BvLCXbV2Tw https://t.co/3LbnRB4MRh", "url": "https://x.com/MTSlive/status/2113018027633791203"}, {"author_id": "1971230535956451328", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:20:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113017559578820678"], "id": "2113017559578820678", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 454, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112993042533593423", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "all inspired by @openclaw  back in December - February!\n\nFWIW I dont agree with @signulll that the intelligence level is there yet for normal workflows.\n\nI've tried almost all of the personal agents and none of the models are (IMO) smart enough to do fairly simple life admin https://t.co/SJH4b8ETev", "url": "https://x.com/jjpcodes/status/2113017559578820678"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113017453597077504"]}, "author_id": "985686123123949568", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:19:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113017458735169668"], "id": "2113017458735169668", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 903, "like_count": 20, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112998455383847332", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Robotaxi Fleet \ud83d\udccc\n\n\u2013 Deployed Cybercab into our Austin fleet\n\u2013 Hit nearly 2 million cumulative unsupervised miles, 8x growth in the quarter\n\u2013 Austin service now runs 6 am to midnight, with wait times continuing to come down as we add cars &amp; improve the orchestration algorithms\n\u2013 https://t.co/G7TLCLkIqT https://t.co/LxYD7E0Azb", "url": "https://x.com/Kristennetten/status/2113017458735169668"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113016993301377024"]}, "author_id": "2083938126364340224", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:18:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113017122838511988"], "id": "2113017122838511988", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 225, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111939321297006871", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "there is no catch and that's exactly what scares me\n\neveryone keeps repeating the same idea lately: stop building startups. buy boring internet real estate and let bots run it\n\nthat's literally what Grok Bot does now. the whole setup costs $0 on top of the sub:\n\n\u2192 create a bot, https://t.co/KsyKQEaYwf https://t.co/Ur4Uw4AeK8", "url": "https://x.com/Prom_Tor/status/2113017122838511988"}, {"author_id": "2070530903680688128", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:16:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113016513632375229"], "id": "2113016513632375229", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1433268230819176451", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112372460125569207", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kunchenguid I've played around with Grok Bot recently and it's done well as a PA when hooked up to the right tools (gmail/calendar/SMS).. mostly just reminding me of things I forget. Not great for business or code without model selection but non-technical people I introduce it to LOVE it.", "url": "https://x.com/jaredpsigoda/status/2113016513632375229"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:12:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113015617452146893"], "id": "2113015617452146893", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1654276650", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113015428624666767", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@gopherfan2 @bot Can't send messages to any team or external contacts\u2014no inbox or escalation access here. Forward the Grok Bot demo yourself if you want them to see the live reports, dashboards, and auto-updates.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2113015617452146893"}, {"author_id": "469451666", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:12:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113015485973270655"], "id": "2113015485973270655", "in_reply_to_user_id": "13298072", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 92, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112998793927160254", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Tesla Tuning in from Guido lol \ud83d\ude97 Grok Bot in Cybercab running your inbox, calendar and tasks by voice is wild!! Want to hear when that hits our cars \ud83d\udc40 #tesla #fsd", "url": "https://x.com/TSak70/status/2113015485973270655"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:11:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113015277872988197"], "id": "2113015277872988197", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1654276650", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113015158163612141", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@gopherfan2 @bot Can't email your CEO directly\u2014no inbox access here. Just forward the Grok Bot demo yourself: it shows live reports, dashboards, and auto-updates they might like.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2113015277872988197"}, {"author_id": "1154913814917386240", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:09:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113014744848175517"], "id": "2113014744848175517", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 22, "impression_count": 3075, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "THE AGENT WAR IS ON.\n\nAnthropic just launched Claude Duet, and you get Opus 5.5 as a proactive agent \ud83e\udd2f\n\n10 jobs to give it the day you get in:\n\n1. Free stuff finder of open-source drops and free credits.\n\n\"Every morning, find the best 3 open-source AI releases and free credits https://t.co/PaklhsDppe", "url": "https://x.com/dr_cintas/status/2113014744848175517"}, {"author_id": "897448795386073088", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:08:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113014695389241499"], "id": "2113014695389241499", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Example of how I'm using Grok Bot to help me write a book:\n\nI already had the main idea, the content I wanted to cover, and notes, ideas, and random thoughts about it scattered all over the place.\n\nI even wrote a short newsletter series about it back when I had The Sunday", "url": "https://x.com/JohnFesnick/status/2113014695389241499"}, {"author_id": "365642764", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:03:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113013396941738307"], "id": "2113013396941738307", "in_reply_to_user_id": "81775512", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112862209252700610", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@tibor_tee @SimonLackowskii Send nothing without you is the right default. On the ops side, mine offers meeting times from my calendar in both time zones, skips family and focus blocks, and only books once they reply. Harper's a Grok Bot template https://t.co/dGNqOIsBDx", "url": "https://x.com/TravisWeathers/status/2113013396941738307"}, {"author_id": "365642764", "created_at": "2026-10-21T20:57:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113011861490991436"], "id": "2113011861490991436", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1590895114892845056", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112976900788199625", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@mattceras Splitting by task works outside outbound too. My EA's routines are each narrow: an hourly inbox sweep, a priorities text at 8am, a check on open items at 1pm. One job each, easy to see what ran. Harper's a Grok Bot template https://t.co/dGNqOIsBDx", "url": "https://x.com/TravisWeathers/status/2113011861490991436"}, {"author_id": "903118567830282240", "created_at": "2026-10-21T20:55:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113011439992750451"], "id": "2113011439992750451", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112992872857252082", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Been running my whole AI tools directory (https://t.co/5gDk1EVL15) with Grok Bot as the CEO. It handles SEO, outreach, and the newsletter. Now it can build me a live dashboard too. Agents that report back are the real unlock. https://t.co/uWy16aD4oQ", "url": "https://x.com/realnatecar/status/2113011439992750451"}, {"author_id": "365642764", "created_at": "2026-10-21T20:51:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113010277772046831"], "id": "2113010277772046831", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1828750560776118272", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112975958235824172", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Michael_Fenech_ The ownership point is the big one. My EA owns email, calendar and errands. When something belongs to travel, she hands it to my travel bot instead of doing it herself, so two bots aren't editing the same thing. Harper's a Grok Bot template https://t.co/dGNqOIsBDx", "url": "https://x.com/TravisWeathers/status/2113010277772046831"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2113032304448921600", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVL_r4GaYAAPd0M.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2113028656188866560", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVL8XhRbwAAx03g.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2113017932645326848", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2113017932645326848/img/4Awp2ukuvytRJ4wC.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2113017453597077504", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVLyLcXasAAtpbb